  "instructions": [
    "Heat the fondue pot to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the thawed peas, crushed candy, coconut milk, tomato sauce, salt, and pepper, and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Reduce the heat to 300 degrees Fahrenheit and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired."
  ],
